  "stories": [
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Profile",
        "zh": "客观履历",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Rope is a cat burglar from the slums of Lungmen, who got caught during a botched caper. Sent to Rhodes Island on a special recommendation from Madam Ch'en after Lungmen formed a partnership with Rhodes Island. \nResponsible for intelligence gathering. Uses a rope and grappling hook in combat to disorient the enemy.",
        "zh": "龙门贫民窟的惯偷，在一次行窃中失手被抓获。在龙门与罗德岛建立合作后，作为特殊人才被陈警官推荐加入罗德岛。\n平时负责情报收集工作，战斗时，则使用擅长的绳索与勾爪，使得敌人晕头转向。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "DIRECT"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Clinical Analysis",
        "zh": "临床诊断分析",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Imaging test for this Operator showed blurry outline of internal organs with visible unusual dark spots. Unusually high concentration of Originium particles were present in her circulation, indicating signs of infection and confirming her as infected at this stage. \n\n[Cell-Originium Assimilation] 18% \nWhile only a few vestiges of infection are visible on surface, internal organs have been severely compromised. \n\n[Blood Originium-Crystal Density] 0.30u/L \nBy the time she joined Rhodes Island, Operator Rope had already missed the best window of opportunity for treatment. Malnutrition and environmental factors put her health in imminent danger. \nCurrently, given proper care, she is in stable condition. I hope she will continue to take better care of herself. \n—Silence",
        "zh": "造影检测结果显示，该干员体内脏器轮廓模糊，可见异常阴影，循环系统内源石颗粒检测异常，有矿石病感染迹象，现阶段可确认为矿石病感染者。\n\n【体细胞与源石融合率】18% \n虽然体表只有寥寥几处源石侵蚀痕迹，但内部器官受感染情况十分严重。\n\n【血液源石结晶密度】0.30u/L\n干员暗索在加入罗德岛时，已经错失了最好的治疗时间，并且由于营养不良和缺少良好的休息环境，单纯从健康意义上来说也处于十分危险的状态。\n目前，经过调养，病情已经趋向稳定，希望本人接下来能够更爱惜自己。\n——赫默",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "25"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 1",
        "zh": "档案资料一",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A coy thief. \nShe smiles at everyone, but it's a polite, distant smile. \nPilfering is second nature to her. She will sometimes pickpocket someone without even realizing it. At least she knows to give it back now.",
        "zh": "轻佻的小贼。\n对谁都笑脸相迎，但从笑容中能感觉到距离感。\n盗窃对她来说几乎已经成了习惯，有时候甚至会下意识地从别人身上顺走东西。至少如今，她已经学会了事后还回去。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "50"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 2",
        "zh": "档案资料二",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Rope doesn't begrudge her parents. She knows sometimes a poor family just has to abandon a child or two. At least her parents cried when they kicked her out of the house. \nRope doesn't hate the world either, knowing that no matter how much she curses the gods, it won't give her what she needs to eat. Not to mention all the worse things she's seen from her years in the slums. \nOf course, Rope never had any problem stealing. She knew it was wrong, but what could she do?",
        "zh": "小暗索并不记恨自己的父母，因为她知道，对越生越穷，越穷越生的贫民来说，抛弃孩子很多时候是一件没有办法的事。至少，她的父母把她赶出门的时候，是哭着的。\n小暗索也不憎恨这个世界，毕竟不管怎么咒骂老天，老天也不会给她钱。而且，在贫民窟摸爬滚打这些年，她已经见过不知多少比自己要惨得多的人和事。\n当然，小暗索也不觉得偷东西有什么问题，她当然知道这是错的，可是，她又能怎么办呢？",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "100"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 3",
        "zh": "档案资料三",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Rope actually loved prison, since her meals were taken care of, and she got a free bed out of the deal. If it wasn't for the rehabilitation classes, she would've gotten herself caught on purpose. \nOf course, she'd still slip up occasionally, but she knew every one of the guards and they were impressed with her thieving skills. \nShe did wonder if they might actually hire her as a cop. What she never expected was getting 'sold' to a place called Rhodes Island.",
        "zh": "小暗索其实相当喜欢监狱，毕竟在那里，一日三餐都能保障，还有床可以睡。如果不是每次进去都要接受思想教育，她说不定每隔一段时间就会主动被抓一次。\n当然，即使偶尔失手才会被抓，在贫民窟混迹了这么多年，她也早就和狱警混熟了。她还知道，自己的盗窃技巧似乎在这些执法人员眼中，还挺厉害。\n她有时候也会想，自己该不会有一天会被吸收成辅警吧。不过，她怎么也想不到，辅警没当上，她就被“卖”给了一个叫罗德岛的组织。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "150"
    },
    {
      "storyTitle": {
        "en": "Archive File 4",
        "zh": "档案资料四",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Rope still isn't used to life on Rhodes Island. \nShe gets food, clothes, and a roof over her head. Plus there's a lot of freaks and weirdos here. Nobody looks down on her because of her background, and even when she does steal from them, they just want her to return it with an apology. \nWith all that, she doesn't need to use any of the survival skills she honed in the slum. It's all very foreign to her. \nBut it feels... not too bad.",
        "zh": "来到罗德岛后，小暗索其实觉得相当不适应。\n虽然这里古怪的人和可怕的人有很多，但她在这里能吃饱穿暖，也没有人嫌弃她的出身，即使她手痒偷了东西，都只是批评她要还回去和道歉。\n她在过去从贫民窟锻炼出来的巧言令色，在罗德岛似乎变得完全不适用了，这让她一时间无所适从。\n但是，这样的感觉，似乎……还不坏。",
        "source": "official",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "unlockType": "FAVOR",
      "unlockParam": "200"
    }
  ]
}
